// "Discard [cards]" [CR#701.9a]: move them from their owner's hand to that
// player's graveyard. Lean `discard`. The hand is in the term, so the
// discarding player is whoever owns it; the deed takes no agent. An
// indefinite subject ("a card") implies its own selection, made by default by
// the affected player [CR#701.9b]; a random selection is marked on the
// indefinite.
KeywordAction(
    name: "discard",
    params: [Subject],
    spelling: "discard",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "discard",
        frame_set: Transitive,
    ),
    body: move(Param(0), hand, graveyard),
)
